      <title>Cornell rape case gets special prosecutor. And, Renee Good's family sues the government</title>
      <author>Brittney Melton</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/10/02/g-s1-146075/up-first-newsletter-cornell-assault-case-christa-pike-jobs-report-renee-good</link>
      <comments>https://text.npr.org/2026/10/02/g-s1-146075/up-first-newsletter-cornell-assault-case-christa-pike-jobs-report-renee-good</comments>
