azonaws.com%2F13%2F6c%2F95a884574a5f85f7db0236b104b1%2Fgettyimages-2291214646.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5000x2812+0+159/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F6c%2F95a884574a5f85f7db0236b104b1%2Fgettyimages-2291214646.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5000x2812+0+159/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F6c%2F95a884574a5f85f7db0236b104b1%2Fgettyimages-2291214646.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5000x2812+0+159/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F6c%2F95a884574a5f85f7db0236b104b1%2Fgettyimages-2291214646.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5000x2812+0+159/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F6c%2F95a884574a5f85f7db0236b104b1%2Fgettyimages-2291214646.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5000x2812+0+159/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F6c%2F95a884574a5f85f7db0236b104b1%2Fgettyimages-2291214646.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5000x2812+0+159/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F6c%2F95a884574a5f85f7db0236b104b1%2Fgettyimages-2291214646.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5000x2812+0+159/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F6c%2F95a884574a5f85f7db0236b104b1%2Fgettyimages-2291214646.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5000x2812+0+159/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F6c%2F95a884574a5f85f7db0236b104b1%2Fgettyimages-2291214646.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5000x2812+0+159/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F6c%2F95a884574a5f85f7db0236b104b1%2Fgettyimages-2291214646.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5000x2812+0+159/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F6c%2F95a884574a5f85f7db0236b104b1%2Fgettyimages-2291214646.jpg" class="img" alt="Sheryl Crow performs in Nashville on Aug. 19, 2026." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Sheryl Crow performs in Nashville on Aug. 19, 2026.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Jason Kempin/Getty Images for ACM&lt;br&gt;                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check out what &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/sections/culture/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NPR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; is watching, reading and listening to this weekend:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍿 Movies:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/29/nx-s1-5982735/forgotten-island-is-a-cluttered-feast-for-the-senses" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Forgotten Island&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; follows childhood friends Jo and Raissa, who are unexpectedly transported to a magical island just before they are about to part ways.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📺 TV:&lt;/strong&gt; The Spanish-language miniseries &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/10/01/nx-s1-5985845/my-sad-dead-review" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;em&gt;My Sad Dead&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; follows an Argentinian doctor who can communicate with ghosts. &lt;em&gt;Fresh Air&lt;/em&gt; critic John Powers describes it as a unique blend of creepiness, sarcastic humor and political anger, unlike anything else on TV.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📚 Books:&lt;/strong&gt; Min Jin Lee's &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/28/nx-s1-5982798/american-hagwon-min-jin-lee-review" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;em&gt;American Hagwon&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the third installment in a planned four-novel series about the Korean diaspora. It explores the complexities of immigration, the fragile promise of America and the purpose of education.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎵 Music: &lt;/strong&gt;Now in her 60s, singer-songwriter Sheryl Crow says she has aged out of pop music. She describes her latest album, &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/10/01/nx-s1-5984965/sheryl-crow-pick-you-up" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pick You Up&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, as exploring questions many of us ask about our identity at this moment in humanity.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;❓ Quiz:&lt;/strong&gt; Bears, Beyoncé, and colleges. This week's news features a mix of serious headlines and lighter moments. Test your memory with &lt;a href="http://npr.org/2026/10/02/g-s1-145638/trump-hegseth-panda-ai-beyonce-news-quiz" target="_blank"&gt;this week's quiz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;3 things to know before you go&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-145890" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 4153;         --source-height: 2336;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4153x2336+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fbe%2F12%2F29a56b2f41deabc5b8f65805d9f9%2Fgettyimages-2298077242.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4153x2336+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fbe%2F12%2F29a56b2f41deabc5b8f65805d9f9%2Fgettyimages-2298077242.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4153x2336+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fbe%2F12%2F29a56b2f41deabc5b8f65805d9f9%2Fgettyimages-2298077242.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4153x2336+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fbe%2F12%2F29a56b2f41deabc5b8f65805d9f9%2Fgettyimages-2298077242.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4153x2336+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fbe%2F12%2F29a56b2f41deabc5b8f65805d9f9%2Fgettyimages-2298077242.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4153x2336+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fbe%2F12%2F29a56b2f41deabc5b8f65805d9f9%2Fgettyimages-2298077242.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4153x2336+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fbe%2F12%2F29a56b2f41deabc5b8f65805d9f9%2F