      <description>&lt;div id="storytext" class="storytext storylocation linkLocation"&gt;       &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Good morning. You're reading the Up First newsletter. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/newsletter/news" target="_blank"&gt;Subscribe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; here to get it delivered to your inbox, and &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/podcasts/510318/up-first/" target="_blank"&gt;listen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; to the Up First podcast for all the news you need to start your day.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;Today's top stories&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-145217" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 3340;         --source-height: 1879;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3340x1879+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2Fff%2F6031d0624b8297cbdd9e1be38f58%2Fap26270356408001.jpg" class="img" alt="Police stand at a road block on the road to RAF Fairford after an incident, in Whelford, England, Sunday, Sept. 27, 2026," loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Police stand at a road block on the road to RAF Fairford after an incident, in Whelford, England, Sunday, Sept. 27, 2026,                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Ben Birchall/PA via AP                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;British authorities have arrested five men near RAF Fairford, a U.K. air base used by U.S. forces in the war against Iran.&lt;/strong&gt; Three suspicious vehicles were stopped near the base, and investigators are examining several possible motives and connections.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;ul class="edTag rte2-style-ul"&gt;&lt;li&gt;🎧 &lt;strong&gt;NPR's Lauren Frayer tells &lt;em&gt;Up First&lt;/em&gt; what we know about the investigation so far&lt;/strong&gt;. Police say a possible Iran link is only one line of inquiry, while British officials are also weighing the broader threat from hostile states. Frayer notes that RAF Fairford has also been a target of anti-war protests. The suspects can be held for up to 14 days without charge under U.K. terrorism laws.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;🎧 &lt;strong&gt;Listen on &lt;em&gt;Morning Edition&lt;/em&gt; for analysis from national security expert Juliette Kayyem&lt;/strong&gt; on how investigators&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/28/nx-s1-5982737/national-security-expert-discusses-alleged-u-k-bomb-plot" target="_blank"&gt; assess a suspected plot&lt;/a&gt; and why U.S. and British officials may be describing it differently.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;       &lt;div id="resg-s1-145248-100" class="bucketwrap internallink insettwocolumn inset2col"&gt;                     &lt;!-- END CLASS="BUCKET IMG" --&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;     &lt;!-- END ID="RESG-S1-145248-100" CLASS="BUCKETWRAP INTERNALLINK INSETTWOCOLUMN INSET2COL " --&gt;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;President Trump says he rejected an Iranian offer for a seven-day pause in fighting and an immediate reopening of the Strait of Hormuz.&lt;/strong&gt; Iran had sought relief from the U.S. naval blockade on its oil exports and access to billions of dollars frozen abroad in exchange for reopening the waterway.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;ul class="edTag rte2-style-ul"&gt;&lt;li&gt;🎧&lt;strong&gt; NPR's Aya Batrawy tells&lt;em&gt; Up First &lt;/em&gt;that oil is moving through the strait, but not at prewar levels.&lt;/strong&gt; Recent Kpler data shows flows averaging about 13 million barrels a day last week, compared with roughly 15 million to 17 million before the war. "There is an absence of peace in the Gulf," Batrawy says, with Washington's Gulf allies "paying the heavy price" of that continued uncertainty.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CNN is back in the White House TV pool after a dayslong dispute over press access. &lt;/strong&gt;The pause meant major moments, including Trump's U.N. appearance and Chinese President Xi Jinping's visit, went without the usual pooled television coverage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;ul class="edTag rte2-style-ul"&gt;&lt;li&gt;🎧 &lt;strong&gt;NPR's Mara Liasson reports that fights with the media may play well with Trump's media-skeptical base, &lt;/strong&gt;but they can also cost him the wall-to-wall coverage he typically seeks. She says the dispute fits&lt;a href="https://one.npr.org/i/nx-s1-5983296:nx-s1-mx-5983296-1" target="_blank"&gt; a broader question &lt;/a&gt;about why Trump is taking positions that run against majority public opinion just weeks before the midterms. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Meanwhile, in a strange twist, CNN is getting new owners with close ties to Trump. NPR's David Folkenflik &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/26/nx-s1-5981103/cnn-is-getting-new-owners-with-close-ties-to-trump" target="_blank"&gt;reports on the unease inside the network&lt;/a&gt; as Paramount moves to take over Warner Bros. Discovery, CNN's parent company.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;       &lt;aside id="mid-story-recommendations-mount-piano" class="mid-story-recommendations-mount-piano" aria-label="recommended stories"&gt;&lt;/aside&gt;    &lt;!-- END ID="MID-STORY-RECOMMENDATIONS-MOUNT-PIANO" CLASS="MID-STORY-RECOMMENDATIONS-MOUNT-PIANO" ARIA-LABEL="RECOMMENDED STORIES" --&gt;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mass shootings across South Africa have killed nearly 40 people in recent days&lt;/strong&gt;. The attacks in Cape Town, Johannesburg and Durban struck a restaurant, tavern and house party, and police&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/27/nx-s1-5982488/south-africa-mass-shootings-killed-38-week" target="_blank"&gt; have not announced &lt;/a&gt;motives in the latest cases.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;Picture show&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resnx-s1-img-6265161" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 10000;         --source-height: 5625;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/10000x5625+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F9e%2F8641c78a46f4afefe2aa2e2f3a47%2Fd5d73cf3-6510-44ec-8e49-6fbaec2e01a0.jpg" class="img" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Artist Sliman Mansour at his home in Jerusalem on Nov. 18, 2025.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Afif Amireh for NPR                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;Born in 1947, the year before Israel's creation, Sliman Mansour said he didn't always think of himself as Palestinian. "In the early 1970s, I started to discover I'm a Palestinian," he told NPR. "So my art took a 90-degree turn." &lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Living under Israeli occupation, he said, made politics impossible to escape. But he also believed beauty was part of how art reached people: "If you don't speak to the hearts of the people, if you don't speak to the feelings of the people, then you don't reach people." &lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Beauty, he said, was "an important way to reach these hearts."&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;Mansour died on Aug. 24 at 79 and was buried in Bir Zeit, in the occupied West Bank, near the olive groves of his ancestors. Listen to an in-person interview with him, and see &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/22/nx-s1-5949930/what-painter-sliman-mansour-told-npr-about-palestinian-rights-and-art-before-he-died" target="_blank"&gt;some of the art here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;Life advice&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-144932" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 1499;         --source-height: 843;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1499x843+0+328/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2F4e%2F1e87d7b74ac78eec6b95033bcb4c%2Fmom.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650